WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
- Halloween is a big
time of the year, right?

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.650
For both of you.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.830
- Always has been.
- Yeah!

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.870
- [Kelly] Do you like dressing up?

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:06.703
- Do you dress up?

00:00:06.703 --> 00:00:07.910
- No, you know what?
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:09.540
- I started acting so young,

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.500
and they pay me to dress up.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.410
- [Kelly] Okay, I get that.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.722
- And so,

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.140
on Halloween I...
- But you should just go as...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:15.973
- Every once,

00:00:15.973 --> 00:00:17.440
I do have, I must admit,

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.070
I do have an Ice Cream Man costume.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:20.903
- [Kelly] Oh no!

00:00:20.903 --> 00:00:21.790
- That I break out.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.623
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:23.456
Is this from the film?

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:24.289
Because that's scary.

00:00:24.289 --> 00:00:25.270
What does the ice cream man sound like?

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:26.103
And I'm afraid to ask,

00:00:26.103 --> 00:00:28.809
'cause I'm going home alone tonight.

00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:29.990
(audience laughing)

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.823
- The ice cream man.

00:00:30.823 --> 00:00:31.656
- [Kelly] Gosh!

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:32.489
No!

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.370
No, no, no.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.611
- Happy day!

00:00:36.611 --> 00:00:38.500
- No! Oh my Gosh.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.030
- A little movie that I worked on in 1993.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:41.863
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:41.863 --> 00:00:42.696
- [Ron] It has cult status.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:42.696 --> 00:00:44.404
- [Clint] It has cult status,

00:00:44.404 --> 00:00:46.010
and I play this wicked ice cream man that,

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.510
- [Kelly] Scary!
- chops up people and animals,

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.560
and puts them in the ice cream.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.958
- Keep talking about it,

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:54.291
it's very very uplifting.
- [Kelly] Wow!

00:00:55.861 --> 00:00:57.260
- Well, Halloween has
always been great for me.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.680
Speaking of my parents,

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.550
I remember in the beginning

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.383
they didn't have much money,

00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:03.220
but the first Halloween I really remember,

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.053
I was four,

00:01:04.053 --> 00:01:05.150
and my dad made me

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.230
a knight in shining armor outfit,

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.090
but he got some boxes
from the grocery store,

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.700
spray-painted it silver,

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.830
and kind of cut them out
and set them over me,

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:17.940
but the last Halloween that I actually

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.093
went out on,

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.050
I was 16,

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:22.560
and I still dressing up,
- [Kelly] (chuckling)

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.000
- and trying to get free candy.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.100
And it was actually,

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.301
- [Kelly] As you do.

00:01:26.301 --> 00:01:27.134
(audience chuckling)

00:01:27.134 --> 00:01:27.967
- It was actually the night

00:01:27.967 --> 00:01:30.740
before my first date with Cheryl,

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:31.993
who's now my wife.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.481
We're coming up on 51 years ago.

00:01:35.481 --> 00:01:36.314
(audience awes)

00:01:36.314 --> 00:01:37.147
- [Kelly] Wow!
(audience clapping)

00:01:37.147 --> 00:01:37.980
- [Ron} Yeah.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.322
- [Kelly] Congratulations!

00:01:39.322 --> 00:01:40.155
- [Ron] Yeah, thank you.

00:01:40.155 --> 00:01:41.300
- [Kelly] That's really
hard to do you know?

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.400
- We talk about straddling your future,

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.230
and your childhood.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:46.700
- [Clint] What did you
dress up that year as?

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.533
- A ghoul.

00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:48.366
I was a karate,

00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:50.541
I was a black belt ghoul.

00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:51.440
- [Kelly] Wait!

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.273
No, no.

00:01:52.273 --> 00:01:53.380
You were a karate ghoul?

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.731
(chuckling)
- Karate ghoul.

00:01:54.731 --> 00:01:55.629
I had a gi and a belt,

00:01:55.629 --> 00:01:58.012
and then green circles.
- [Kelly] Not just a ghoul,

00:01:58.012 --> 00:01:58.845
you were a ninja ghoul

00:01:58.845 --> 00:02:00.693
- I was a ninja ghoul.
- [Kelly] Love it!

